=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'外观染色'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cost: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, frequency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repeatable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, priority: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cosmetic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>货币之间的兑换关系是经济设计中最敏感的环节。如果高级货币可以无限制地兑换为基础货币，玩家会寻找最高效的&quot;套利&quot;路径，破坏设计者预设的经济节奏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物品价值体系\">物品价值体系</h2><p>物品价值体系决定了游戏内每件物品&quot;值多少钱&quot;。这不仅是一个数值问题，更是一个心理学问题——物品的感知价值往往与其实际效用不成正比。</p>\n<p>物品稀缺度分级是价值体系的基础：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 稀缺度金字塔&#10;        S5[传说 - 极稀有] --&gt; S4[史诗 - 稀有]&#10;        S4 --&gt; S3[稀有 - 中等]&#10;        S3 --&gt; S2[优秀 - 常见]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S1[普通 - 极常见]&#10;    end&#10;    S5 --&gt; V5[极高感知价值]&#10;    S3 --&gt; V3[中等感知价值]&#10;    S1 --&gt; V1[低感知价值]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 稀缺度金字塔\n        S5[传说 - 极稀有] --&gt; S4[史诗 - 稀有]\n        S4 --&gt; S3[稀有 - 中等]\n        S3 --&gt; S2[优秀 - 常见]\n        S2 --&gt; S1[普通 - 极常见]\n    end\n    S5 --&gt; V5[极高感知价值]\n    S3 --&gt; V3[中等感知价值]\n    S1 --&gt; V1[低感知价值]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品质等级</th>\n<th>掉落概率</th>\n<th>属性加成</th>\n<th>交易价值</th>\n<th>心理效应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通（白）</td>\n<td>60-70%</td>\n<td>基准值</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>基线参照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优秀（绿）</td>\n<td>20-25%</td>\n<td>+10-20%</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>轻度满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀有（蓝）</td>\n<td>8-12%</td>\n<td>+25-40%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>明显愉悦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>史诗（紫）</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>+50-75%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强烈兴奋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传说（橙）</td>\n<td>0.5-1%</td>\n<td>+100%+</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>狂喜/炫耀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>物品的真实价值来自三个来源：<strong>功能价值</strong>（提升战斗力或效率）、<strong>社交价值</strong>（在其他玩家面前展示）和<strong>收藏价值</strong>（完成集合的满足感）。纯功能价值的物品在获得后价值迅速衰减（被更好的替代），而具有社交和收藏价值的物品则保持长期吸引力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ItemValue {&#10;  functionalValue: number;&#10;  socialValue: number;&#10;  collectionValue: number;&#10;  depreciationRate: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculatePerceivedValue(item: ItemValue, daysSinceAcquired: number): number {&#10;  const functionalDecay = item.functionalValue * Math.exp(-item.depreciationRate * daysSinceAcquired);&#10;  const persistentValue = item.socialValue + item.collectionValue;&#10;  return functionalDecay + persistentValue;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  functionalValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  socialValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  collectionValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  depreciationRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculatePerceivedValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">daysSinceAcquired</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> functionalDecay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.functionalValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item.depreciationRate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daysSinceAcquired);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> persistentValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.socialValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.collectionValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functionalDecay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> persistentValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"交易系统与市场设计\">交易系统与市场设计</h2><p>玩家间交易系统是多人游戏经济的核心组件。它将单向的&quot;系统→玩家&quot;资源流变成了多向的&quot;玩家↔玩家&quot;网络，极大增加了经济的复杂度和活力。</p>\n<p>交易系统的设计面临两个核心矛盾：</p>\n<p><strong>自由度与可控性</strong>——完全自由的交易允许&quot;看不见的手&quot;调节市场，但也为金币工作室和价格操控提供了空间。设计者需要通过交易税、绑定机制和价格区间等手段维持市场秩序。</p>\n<p><strong>效率与社交性</strong>——自动化的拍卖行提高了交易效率，但削弱了面对面讨价还价的社交体验。魔兽世界的拍卖行和 EVE Online 的区域市场代表了两种不同的设计取向。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TradeSystemConfig {&#10;  taxRate: number;&#10;  listingFee: number;&#10;  maxListings: number;&#10;  priceFloor: number;&#10;  priceCeiling: number;&#10;  bindOnTrade: boolean;&#10;  tradeCooldown: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MarketOrder {&#10;  itemId: string;&#10;  sellerId: string;&#10;  price: number;&#10;  quantity: number;&#10;  expireTime: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function executeTrade(order: MarketOrder, buyer: PlayerWallet, config: TradeSystemConfig): TradeResult {&#10;  const totalCost = order.price * order.quantity;&#10;  const tax = totalCost * config.taxRate;&#10;  const sellerReceives = totalCost - tax;&#10;&#10;  if (buyer.balance &lt; totalCost) {&#10;    return { success: false, reason: &#39;insufficient_funds&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    success: true,&#10;    buyerCost: totalCost,&#10;    sellerIncome: sellerReceives,&#10;    taxCollected: tax,&#10;    reason: &#39;completed&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TradeSystemConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  taxRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  listingFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxListings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priceFloor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priceCeiling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bindOnTrade</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tradeCooldown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MarketOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sellerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expireTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executeTrade</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MarketOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buyer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlayerWallet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TradeSystemConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TradeResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order.price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order.quantity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tax</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.taxRate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sellerReceives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tax;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (buyer.balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCost) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'insufficient_funds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buyerCost: totalCost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sellerIncome: sellerReceives,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taxCollected: tax,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>交易税是虚拟经济中最重要的&quot;排水口&quot;之一。它在每次交易中从系统中移除一定比例的货币，对抗通货膨胀。税率的设置需要平衡——过高的税率抑制交易活跃度，过低则无法有效回收货币。一般来说，5%-15% 是常见的交易税区间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反作弊与经济安全\">反作弊与经济安全</h2><p>虚拟经济面临的安全威胁不亚于真实金融系统。金币工作室（Gold Farming）、物品复制（Item Duplication）和市场操控（Market Manipulation）都可能摧毁精心设计的经济体系。</p>\n<p>经济安全设计的核心策略：</p>\n<p><strong>绑定机制</strong>——物品绑定（Soulbound）是最有效的反流通手段。拾取绑定（BoP）的物品完全退出交易市场，装备绑定（BoE）的物品只允许交易一次。绑定比例直接决定了经济系统的封闭程度。</p>\n<p><strong>频率监控</strong>——异常交易频率检测。当某个账号的交易频率或单次交易金额超出正常范围时触发预警。</p>\n<p><strong>总量控制</strong>——服务器级别的货币总量监控。当总量超过设计阈值时，自动激活货币回收机制（增加消耗、减少产出、推出限时消耗活动）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁类型</th>\n<th>攻击方式</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>防御手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>刷金外挂</td>\n<td>自动化脚本刷怪</td>\n<td>通货膨胀</td>\n<td>行为检测+验证码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品复制</td>\n<td>利用协议漏洞</td>\n<td>物价崩溃</td>\n<td>服务端校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场操控</td>\n<td>大量买入再高价卖出</td>\n<td>价格扭曲</td>\n<td>价格波动限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实货币交易</td>\n<td>场外法币交易</td>\n<td>公平性破坏</td>\n<td>绑定机制+监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((虚拟经济体系))&#10;    货币体系&#10;      基础货币&#10;      高级货币&#10;      时间货币&#10;      声望货币&#10;    物品价值&#10;      稀缺度分级&#10;      三重价值来源&#10;      感知价值曲线&#10;    交易系统&#10;      自由度vs可控性&#10;      拍卖行设计&#10;      交易税机制&#10;    经济安全&#10;      绑定机制&#10;      频率监控&#10;      总量控制\">mindmap\n  root((虚拟经济体系))\n    货币体系\n      基础货币\n      高级货币\n      时间货币\n      声望货币\n    物品价值\n      稀缺度分级\n      三重价值来源\n      感知价值曲线\n    交易系统\n      自由度vs可控性\n      拍卖行设计\n      交易税机制\n    经济安全\n      绑定机制\n      频率监控\n      总量控制</pre><ul>\n<li>虚拟经济的核心是生产、交易、消耗和存储四大子系统的平衡</li>\n<li>多层货币体系让不同类型货币服务不同目的，兑换关系需严格控制</li>\n<li>物品价值来自功能、社交和收藏三个维度，社交和收藏价值抵抗贬值</li>\n<li>交易系统需要在自由度和可控性之间寻找平衡，交易税是关键的货币回收手段</li>\n<li>经济安全设计需要绑定机制、频率监控和总量控制的多层防御</li>\n<li>虚拟经济是持续运营的系统，需要实时监控和动态调控</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"虚拟经济体系","id":"虚拟经济体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"货币体系设计","id":"货币体系设计"},{"level":2,"text":"物品价值体系","id":"物品价值体系"},{"level":2,"text":"交易系统与市场设计","id":"交易系统与市场设计"},{"level":2,"text":"反作弊与经济安全","id":"反作弊与经济安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"关卡原型与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/level-prototyping"},"next":{"title":"资源流动与循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/resource-flow"}}